<concept id="t00119">
	<title id="e00607">Horn </title>
	<shortdesc>Press the area indicated by the horn symbol on your steering wheel to sound the horn (see illustration).</shortdesc>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>steering wheel
					<indexterm>horn</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00608">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00609">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i26_B05_004_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The horn operates only when you press this area. Check the horn regularly to be sure it operates properly.</p>
		<note type="note" id="e00610">
			<p>Do not strike the horn with your fist. Do not press on the horn with a sharp or pointed object.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
